  "assumptions": [
   "About 560 per arm (2,800 total) to detect 0.12 points at 80% power, alpha .05 two-sided, pooled SD about 0.9 (implied by source SEs); 0.12 allows for shrinkage from the observed -0.17.",
   "Pre-treatment trust used as a covariate.",
   "Delayed re-measure after about one week uses the same scale; expect attrition so recruit extra.",
   "Platform: Lucid with the same exclusions as the source; compensation per panel norms."
  ],
  "unresolved": [
   "Actual video files, edited no-fallibility cut, transcript and neutral video must be supplied by the research team.",
   "Delayed one-week follow-up wave must be fielded separately; its instrument repeats the post-trust items.",
   "IRB number and compensation."
